<adventures id="ADS-0000000804" description="GP1.01">
  <adventure id="ADV-0000000855">
    <description>The runaway Bovo</description>
    <quest id="QUE-0000001914">
      <description>Speak to Bella</description>
      <line description="Bella grant">
        <trigger>
          <object type="questData.TalkQuestTrigger">
            <identifier>H001</identifier>
            <isPrimary>true</isPrimary>
          </object>
        </trigger>
        <conditions />
        <actions>
          <object type="questData.DialogueAction">
            <text>I need your help. Marta Thomas has just told me that one of her bovos has gone missing. It must have drifted through the air from the Overgaard Skylands and landed on solid ground!</text>
          </object>
          <object type="questData.DialogueAction">
            <text>You’ll be able to bring it back to her with a carrot on a stick. You can grow some carrots in a garden and you’ll find some branches in Darkcomb Forest. You will also need some tassel corn which we can make string from. Bring me all of that and I’ll help you. </text>
          </object>
          <object type="questData.LogAdventureBeginAction" />
          <object type="questData.AddQuestAction">
            <questId>QUE-0000001917</questId>
          </object>
          <object type="questData.AddQuestAction">
            <questId>QUE-0000002086</questId>
          </object>
          <object type="questData.RemoveQuestAction" />
          <object type="questData.AddQuestAction">
            <questId>QUE-0000002087</questId>
          </object>
        </actions>
      </line>
    </quest>
    <quest id="QUE-0000002086" visible="False">
      <description unusedLocId="LOC-0000005087">Add bovo</description>
      <line description="add bovo">
        <trigger>
          <object type="questData.EnterZoneTrigger">
            <zoneName>Z012</zoneName>
          </object>
        </trigger>
        <conditions />
        <actions>
          <object type="questData.AddZoneItemAnywhereAction">
            <template>LostBovoTemplate</template>
            <instanceIdentifier>missingbovo</instanceIdentifier>
            <zone>Z012</zone>
            <x>82</x>
            <y>31</y>
          </object>
          <object type="questData.RemoveQuestAction" />
        </actions>
      </line>
    </quest>
    <quest id="QUE-0000002087" visible="False">
      <description unusedLocId="LOC-0000005088">Add stick</description>
      <line description="add stick">
        <trigger>
          <object type="questData.EnterZoneTrigger">
            <zoneName>Z016</zoneName>
          </object>
        </trigger>
        <conditions />
        <actions>
          <object type="questData.AddZoneItemAnywhereAction">
            <template>T0034dTemplate</template>
            <instanceIdentifier>stick</instanceIdentifier>
            <zone>Z016</zone>
            <x>23</x>
            <y>23</y>
          </object>
          <object type="questData.RemoveQuestAction" />
        </actions>
      </line>
    </quest>
    <quest id="QUE-0000001917" targetTemplate="DirtTemplate">
      <description>Grow a carrot and some tassel corn and bring them to Bella</description>
      <line description="Bella Complete">
        <trigger>
          <object type="questData.TalkQuestTrigger">
            <identifier>H001</identifier>
            <isPrimary>true</isPrimary>
          </object>
        </trigger>
        <conditions>
          <object type="questData.HasMultipleItemsCondition">
            <template>P008ProduceTemplate</template>
            <count>1</count>
          </object>
          <object type="questData.HasMultipleItemsCondition">
            <template>P028ProduceTemplate</template>
            <count>1</count>
          </object>
        </conditions>
        <actions>
          <object type="questData.DialogueAction">
            <text>Good work! Now we’re only missing a branch. Go look for one in Darkcomb Forest.</text>
          </object>
          <object type="questData.AddQuestAction">
            <questId>QUE-0000001915</questId>
          </object>
          <object type="questData.AddQuestAction">
            <questId>QUE-0000002087</questId>
          </object>
          <object type="questData.RemoveMultipleInventoryAction">
            <template>P008ProduceTemplate</template>
            <count>1</count>
          </object>
          <object type="questData.RemoveMultipleInventoryAction">
            <template>P028ProduceTemplate</template>
            <count>1</count>
          </object>
          <object type="questData.RemoveQuestAction" />
        </actions>
      </line>
      <line description="Bella Reminder">
        <trigger>
          <object type="questData.TalkQuestTrigger">
            <identifier>H001</identifier>
            <isPrimary>false</isPrimary>
          </object>
        </trigger>
        <conditions />
        <actions>
          <object type="questData.DialogueAction">
            <text>The carrots are growing in the garden. You’ll also have to grow some Tassel Corn to make string.</text>
          </object>
        </actions>
      </line>
    </quest>
    <quest id="QUE-0000001915" targetTemplate="T0034dTemplate">
      <description>Find some branches and bring them to Bella.</description>
      <line description="Bella complete">
        <trigger>
          <object type="questData.TalkQuestTrigger">
            <identifier>H001</identifier>
            <isPrimary>true</isPrimary>
          </object>
        </trigger>
        <conditions>
          <object type="questData.HasMultipleItemsCondition">
            <template>I079Template</template>
            <count>1</count>
          </object>
        </conditions>
        <actions>
          <object type="questData.DialogueAction">
            <text>Well done. Now that you have a carrot, a branch and some Tassel Corn string, we’ll be able to assemble a sort of “Bovo fishing rod” to entice it back home.</text>
          </object>
          <object type="questData.DialogueAction">
            <text>I’m not sure where the bovo is, but it’s probably the only one wandering around on solid ground. When you’ve  found it, use the carrot on a stick on it and it’ll float back to the Overgaard Skylands. Talk to Martha Thomas once you’ve done that: she might have a reward to give you.</text>
          </object>
          <object type="questData.RemoveMultipleInventoryAction">
            <template>I079Template</template>
            <count>1</count>
          </object>
          <object type="questData.AddMultipleInventoryAction">
            <itemId>I074Template</itemId>
            <count>1</count>
          </object>
          <object type="questData.AddQuestAction">
            <questId>QUE-0000001916</questId>
          </object>
          <object type="questData.RemoveQuestAction" />
        </actions>
      </line>
      <line description="Bella reminder">
        <trigger>
          <object type="questData.TalkQuestTrigger">
            <identifier>H001</identifier>
            <isPrimary>false</isPrimary>
          </object>
        </trigger>
        <conditions />
        <actions>
          <object type="questData.DialogueAction">
            <text>You can find some branches in Darkcomb Forest.</text>
          </object>
        </actions>
      </line>
    </quest>
    <quest id="QUE-0000001916" targetTemplate="LostBovoTemplate" targetZone="Z012">
      <description>Use the carrot on a stick on the lost bovo</description>
      <line description="use COS">
        <trigger>
          <object type="questData.GiveItemTrigger">
            <inventoryTemplate>I074Template</inventoryTemplate>
            <targetTemplate>LostBovoTemplate</targetTemplate>
          </object>
        </trigger>
        <conditions />
        <actions>
          <object type="questData.PlayMovieClipAction">
            <fileName>Flash/Adventures/Art/CutScenes/GP01.swf</fileName>
          </object>
          <object type="questData.RemoveZoneItemAnywhereAction">
            <template>LostBovoTemplate</template>
            <instanceIdentifier>missingbovo</instanceIdentifier>
          </object>
          <object type="questData.AddQuestAction">
            <questId>QUE-0000001918</questId>
          </object>
          <object type="questData.RemoveQuestAction" />
        </actions>
      </line>
      <line description="Bella reminder">
        <trigger>
          <object type="questData.TalkQuestTrigger">
            <identifier>H001</identifier>
            <isPrimary>false</isPrimary>
          </object>
        </trigger>
        <conditions />
        <actions>
          <object type="questData.DialogueAction">
            <text>When you’ve found the bovo, use the carrot on a stick on it and it will float back to the Overgaard Skylands. Talk to Marta Thomas once you’ve done that: she might have a reward to give you.</text>
          </object>
        </actions>
      </line>
    </quest>
    <quest id="QUE-0000001918">
      <description>Talk to Marta Thomas</description>
      <line description="Marta complete">
        <trigger>
          <object type="questData.TalkQuestTrigger">
            <identifier>C019</identifier>
            <isPrimary>true</isPrimary>
          </object>
        </trigger>
        <conditions />
        <actions>
          <object type="questData.DialogueAction">
            <text>Oh, Bella told me that you helped me find my Bovo. It came floating back home. What a relief! I’ll never let it out of my sight. Thanks.</text>
          </object>
          <object type="questData.AddHorseshoesAction">
            <count>10</count>
          </object>
          <object type="questData.LogAdventureEndAction" />
          <object type="questData.RemoveQuestAction" />
          <object type="questData.ShowAdventureCompleteAction" />
        </actions>
      </line>
      <line description="Bella reminder">
        <trigger>
          <object type="questData.TalkQuestTrigger">
            <identifier>H001</identifier>
            <isPrimary>false</isPrimary>
          </object>
        </trigger>
        <conditions />
        <actions>
          <object type="questData.DialogueAction">
            <text>When you’ve found the bovo, use the carrot on a stick on it and it will float back to the Overgaard Skylands. Talk to Marta Thomas once you’ve done that: she might have a reward to give you.</text>
          </object>
        </actions>
      </line>
    </quest>
  </adventure>
